OL,3,AHow fields of Fermanagh helped Daisy
OL,4,AEdgar-Jones prepare for her latest film
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor Daisy Edgar-Jones is no stranger
OL,7,Fto Ireland, having spent five months in
OL,8,Fthe country filming hit drama Normal
OL,9,FPeople which was released in 2020.
OL,11,FBut it was actually fields in County
OL,12,FFermanagh, where some of her family
OL,13,Flive, that helped her prepare for the
OL,14,Frole of beloved character Elinor
OL,15,FDashwood in Jane Austen's Sense and
OL,16,FSensibility, some 20 years before.
OL,18,FHer mother is from County Down and
OL,19,FEdgar-Jones spent her childhood roaming
OL,20,Ffields in Northern Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
