OL,3,AHow fields of Fermanagh helped Daisy
OL,4,AEdgar-Jones prepare for her latest film
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I remember big long summers when I was
OL,7,Fvery young in Fermanagh in the fields
OL,8,Fwhich definitely helped with my Sense
OL,9,Fand Sensibility journey because I was
OL,10,Fdoing a lot of the similar wandering
OL,11,Faround, with not much to do, under the
OL,12,Fbig sky and I love being here," she
OL,13,Ftold BBC News NI.
